Tue Nov 17 04:18:34 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- Add BuildRequires pkgconfig(epoxy): upstream meson.build resolves
  egl and glesv2 with required:false and falls back to dependency('epoxy')
  for either one. Declare the documented fallback so the build still
  configures if mesa's EGL/GLES pkgconfig files are ever absent, instead
  of relying on epoxy being pulled in transitively by another -devel
  package.

