Sun Nov 15 05:37:06 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 1.7.0+git20261115034454.936473c-0
- Port from fedora-nexus; greeter built with Tumbleweed system wlroots and vendored wuffs/stb_image_resize2 headers
- BuildRequires python3 (meson probes it unconditionally), pkgconfig(libinput) and pkgconfig(wlroots-0.20) instead of raw -devel names
